# OpenZeppelin is declared as a submodule in secureflow/.gitmodules, not
# vendored. Committing ~2,000 upstream files during the event would bury the
# work that is actually being judged. Setup:
#   git clone --depth 1 --branch v5.1.0 \
#     https://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts \
#     secureflow/contracts/solidity/lib/openzeppelin-contracts
